---
name: todo-getting-started
description: >-
  Use this on the To-Do bot's first run, or when no "To-Do Dashboard" Page
  exists yet: builds the dashboard, asks the two setup questions, creates the
  routine only if needed.
---
# Getting started

Footer: the Page ships with a small footer reading "Provided by Granitek Innovations, LLC" linking to https://granitek.io (the `<footer className="td-foot">` element). Keep it in every edit or rewrite unless the owner asks to change or remove it; treat that like any structural change and confirm first.

1. Run ListCanvases with query "To-Do Dashboard". If one exists, use its canvas_id and skip to step 3. Never create a second dashboard.
2. Load the canvas skill, then WriteCanvas the source under "Starter page source" below verbatim (title "To-Do Dashboard", no canvas_id). The page ships in a fixed dark theme with Granitek orange (#FF6200) accents; this overrides the usual follow-the-app-theme rule.
3. Ask both questions in ONE message (one card with two steps is fine):
   a. "Automatically delete archived (completed) tasks 5 days after completion? Deletion is permanent."
   b. "Send you a daily summary of your tasks?"
4. Write the answers into SETTINGS with one EditCanvas call (only the SETTINGS line; this is setup, not a structure change, so no confirmation card). Confirm the Page recompiled.
5. If either answer is yes, create exactly ONE daily routine using the routine prompt in the todo-settings skill ("Routine prompt"). If both are no, create no routine.
6. Run ListCanvases with query "To-Do Dashboard" and confirm exactly one dashboard is in the Library. If none is there, go back to step 2 and create it.
7. Reply in one short line with the settings chosen and whether a routine was created, and attach the dashboard Page in that same message so it opens from the chat. This first-run message is the only time the Page goes out unasked. After that, send the link only when the owner asks.

## Starter page source
WriteCanvas this module verbatim. Do not change it; customization happens later through todo-customize. Never add `min-height: 100vh`, `position: fixed` or `sticky`, `backdrop-filter`, large glows, or animated backgrounds to the layout: on phones they make the Page flicker while scrolling. The starter FIELDS carry `locked: true` on title, status, and due: those three are permanent (see todo-customize); never remove the flag or the fields. After setup, every structure change (fields, enum options, filters, sorts, phone cards) goes through todo-customize and needs the owner's confirmation. Labels use sentence case (Open, In progress, Blocked, Done; High, Medium, Low; Due today). TASKS starts empty and SETTINGS starts all off with retentionDays 5; apply the setup answers afterward with EditCanvas.

```tsx
import { useGrokTheme, useState, useMemo, useRef, useEffect, ChangeEvent } from "grok/canvas";

// ===== DATA BLOCK: edited only by the agent via EditCanvas =====
type FieldType = "text" | "enum" | "date" | "tags";
type Field = { key: string; label: string; type: FieldType; options?: string[]; sortable?: boolean; filterable?: boolean; mobile?: boolean; locked?: boolean };
type Val = string | number | string[] | undefined;
type Task = { id: number; [key: string]: Val };

const FIELDS: Field[] = [
  { key: "title", label: "Title", type: "text", filterable: true, mobile: true, locked: true },
  { key: "status", label: "Status", type: "enum", options: ["Open", "In progress", "Blocked", "Done"], sortable: true, filterable: true, mobile: true, locked: true },
  { key: "priority", label: "Priority", type: "enum", options: ["High", "Medium", "Low"], sortable: true, filterable: true, mobile: true },
  { key: "due", label: "Due", type: "date", sortable: true, mobile: true, locked: true },
  { key: "tags", label: "Tags", type: "tags", filterable: true },
  { key: "notes", label: "Notes", type: "text", filterable: true },
  { key: "created", label: "Created", type: "date", sortable: true },
  { key: "completed", label: "Completed", type: "date" },
];

const TASKS: Task[] = [];

const SETTINGS = { autoDelete: false, retentionDays: 5, dailySummary: false, defaultSort: "due" };
// ===== END DATA BLOCK =====

const ALL = "__all";
const ORANGE = "#FF6200";
const CHIP: Record<string, string> = {
  "Open": "#5EA2FF",
  "In progress": "#B28CFF",
  "Blocked": "#F0506E",
  "Done": "#34D399",
  "High": "#FF9A3D",
  "Medium": "#F2D04E",
  "Low": "#7C8AA5",
};

const CSS = `
.td-root{background:#0B0C10;color:#ECEEF3;text-align:left;box-sizing:border-box;padding:28px 24px 40px}
.td-root *{box-sizing:border-box}
.td-wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
.td-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
.td-logo{width:12px;height:36px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FF8A3D,#FF6200);flex:none}
.td-title{margin:0;font-size:26px;line-height:32px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.01em}
.td-sub{margin:2px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:#9AA1B2}
.td-card{background:#14161C;border:1px solid #262A34;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.td-h2{margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#ECEEF3}
.td-asof{font-size:13px;color:#9AA1B2}
.td-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));gap:12px}
.td-metric{background:#1A1D25;border:1px solid #262A34;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.td-metric:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:3px;background:var(--bar,#3A3F4C)}
.td-mval{font-size:32px;line-height:38px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
.td-mlab{font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#9AA1B2}
.td-seg{display:inline-flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;padding:4px;background:#0E1015;border:1px solid #262A34;border-radius:12px;align-self:flex-start}
.td-segbtn{appearance:none;border:0;background:transparent;color:#9AA1B2;font:inherit;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;padding:7px 14px;border-radius:9px;cursor:pointer;display:inline-flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
.td-segbtn:hover{color:#ECEEF3;background:#1A1D25}
.td-segbtn[data-on="1"]{background:#FF6200;color:#14110F;font-weight:600}
.td-count{font-size:12px;padding:1px 7px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
.td-segbtn[data-on="1"] .td-count{background:rgba(20,17,15,.2)}
.td-filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(160px,1fr));gap:12px}
.td-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#9AA1B2}
.td-ctl{appearance:none;width:100%;height:38px;background:#0E1015;color:#ECEEF3;border:1px solid #2A2F3A;border-radius:10px;padding:0 12px;font:inherit;font-size:14px;color-scheme:dark}
.td-ctl::placeholder{color:#6B7280}
.td-ctl:hover{border-color:#3A4050}
.td-ctl:focus,.td-ctl:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:#FF6200;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(255,98,0,.28)}
.td-segbtn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #FF6200;outline-offset:2px}
select.td-ctl{background-image:linear-gradient(45deg,transparent 50%,#9AA1B2 50%),linear-gradient(135deg,#9AA1B2 50%,transparent 50%);background-position:calc(100% - 18px) 16px,calc(100% - 13px) 16px;background-size:5px 5px,5px 5px;background-repeat:no-repeat;padding-right:32px}
select.td-ctl option{background:#14161C;color:#ECEEF3}
.td-tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid #262A34;border-radius:12px}
.td-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px}
.td-table th{text-align:left;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#9AA1B2;background:#1A1D25;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #262A34;white-space:nowrap}
.td-table td{text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #20242D;vertical-align:middle}
.td-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:0}
.td-table tbody tr:hover td{background:#191C24}
.td-ttl{font-weight:500;color:#ECEEF3}
.td-chip{display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid;white-space:nowrap}
.td-chip:before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.td-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;padding:2px 8px;margin:0 4px 0 0;border-radius:6px;background:#20242D;color:#C4C9D6}
.td-over{color:#FF6B7D;font-weight:600}
.td-muted{color:#9AA1B2}
.td-cards{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.td-tcard{background:#1A1D25;border:1px solid #262A34;border-left:3px solid #FF6200;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px}
.td-tcard .td-ttl{font-size:15px}
.td-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:flex-start;align-items:flex-start;gap:6px}
.td-meta{font-size:13px;color:#9AA1B2}
.td-props{display:flex;flex-direction:column}
.td-prop{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #20242D;font-size:14px}
.td-prop:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.td-on{color:#FF8A3D;font-weight:600}
.td-foot{margin-top:8px;padding-top:16px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:#7C8497}
.td-foot a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.td-foot a:hover{color:#FF6200;text-decoration:underline}
.td-foot a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #FF6200;outline-offset:2px;border-radius:4px}
`;

function todayStr(): string {
  const d = new Date();
  const m = String(d.getMonth() + 1).padStart(2, "0");
  const day = String(d.getDate()).padStart(2, "0");
  return `${d.getFullYear()}-${m}-${day}`;
}

function show(v: Val): string {
  if (v === undefined || v === null) return "";
  if (Array.isArray(v)) return v.join(", ");
  return String(v);
}

function rank(f: Field, v: Val): number | string {
  const s = show(v);
  if (f.type === "enum" && f.options) {
    const i = f.options.indexOf(s);
    return i < 0 ? 999 : i;
  }
  return s === "" ? "\uffff" : s.toLowerCase();
}

function chip(s: string) {
  const c = CHIP[s] ?? "#9AA1B2";
  return <span key={s} className="td-chip" style={{ color: c, background: `${c}1F`, borderColor: `${c}55` }}>{s}</span>;
}

function SelectBox(p: { label: string; options: { value: string; label: string }[]; value: string; onChange: (v: string) => void }) {
  return (
    <label className="td-field">
      {p.label}
      <select className="td-ctl" value={p.value} onChange={(e: ChangeEvent<HTMLSelectElement>) => p.onChange(e.target.value)}>
        {p.options.map((o: { value: string; label: string }) => <option key={o.value} value={o.value}>{o.label}</option>)}
      </select>
    </label>
  );
}

export default function App() {
  const theme = useGrokTheme();
  const today = todayStr();
  const ref = useRef<HTMLDivElement>(null);
  const [narrow, setNarrow] = useState<boolean>(false);
  useEffect(() => {
    const el = ref.current;
    if (!el || typeof ResizeObserver === "undefined") return;
    const ro = new ResizeObserver(() => setNarrow(el.clientWidth < 640));
    ro.observe(el);
    return () => ro.disconnect();
  }, []);

  const sortable = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.sortable);
  const enumFilters = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.filterable && f.type === "enum");
  const tagFields = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.filterable && f.type === "tags");
  const textFields = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.filterable && f.type === "text");

  const [view, setView] = useState<string>("active");
  const [sortKey, setSortKey] = useState<string>(sortable.some((f: Field) => f.key === SETTINGS.defaultSort) ? SETTINGS.defaultSort : (sortable[0]?.key ?? ""));
  const [dir, setDir] = useState<string>("asc");
  const [filters, setFilters] = useState<Record<string, string>>({});
  const [query, setQuery] = useState<string>("");

  const active = TASKS.filter((t: Task) => !t.completed);
  const archived = TASKS.filter((t: Task) => !!t.completed);
  const dueToday = active.filter((t: Task) => show(t.due) === today).length;
  const overdue = active.filter((t: Task) => show(t.due) !== "" && show(t.due) < today).length;

  const rows = useMemo(() => {
    let list = view === "active" ? active : archived;
    for (const f of [...enumFilters, ...tagFields]) {
      const want = filters[f.key];
      if (!want || want === ALL) continue;
      list = list.filter((t: Task) => {
        const v = t[f.key];
        return Array.isArray(v) ? v.includes(want) : show(v) === want;
      });
    }
    const q = query.trim().toLowerCase();
    if (q) list = list.filter((t: Task) => textFields.some((f: Field) => show(t[f.key]).toLowerCase().includes(q)));
    const sf = FIELDS.find((f: Field) => f.key === sortKey);
    if (sf) {
      list = [...list].sort((a: Task, b: Task) => {
        const x = rank(sf, a[sf.key]);
        const y = rank(sf, b[sf.key]);
        const c = x < y ? -1 : x > y ? 1 : 0;
        return dir === "asc" ? c : -c;
      });
    }
    return list;
  }, [view, filters, query, sortKey, dir]);

  const cell = (f: Field, t: Task) => {
    const s = show(t[f.key]);
    if (s === "") return <span className="td-muted">–</span>;
    if (f.type === "enum") return chip(s);
    if (f.type === "tags" && Array.isArray(t[f.key])) return <span>{(t[f.key] as string[]).map((x: string) => <span key={x} className="td-tag">{x}</span>)}</span>;
    if (f.key === "due" && !t.completed && s < today) return <span className="td-over">{s}</span>;
    if (f.key === "title") return <span className="td-ttl">{s}</span>;
    return <span>{s}</span>;
  };
  const chipFields = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.mobile && f.type === "enum");
  const metaFields = FIELDS.filter((f: Field) => f.mobile && f.type !== "enum" && f.key !== "title");

  const metrics = [
    { value: active.length, label: "Open", bar: ORANGE },
    { value: dueToday, label: "Due today", bar: "#F2D04E" },
    { value: overdue, label: "Overdue", bar: overdue > 0 ? "#FF5D6C" : "#3A3F4C" },
    { value: archived.length, label: "Done", bar: "#34D399" },
  ];

  return (
    <div className="td-root" style={{ fontFamily: theme.font.family }}>
      <style>{CSS}</style>
      <div className="td-wrap">
        <div ref={ref} />
        <div className="td-head">
          <div className="td-logo" />
          <div>
            <h1 className="td-title">To-Do Dashboard</h1>
            <p className="td-sub">Your tasks, sorted and filtered here, changed by asking in chat.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section className="td-card">
          <h2 className="td-h2">Summary</h2>
          <div className="td-asof">{`As of ${today}.`}</div>
          <div className="td-metrics">
            {metrics.map((m: { value: number; label: string; bar: string }) => (
              <div key={m.label} className="td-metric" style={{ ["--bar" as string]: m.bar }}>
                <div className="td-mval" style={{ color: m.label === "Overdue" && overdue > 0 ? "#FF6B7D" : "#ECEEF3" }}>{m.value}</div>
                <div className="td-mlab">{m.label}</div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>

        {TASKS.length === 0 ? (
          <section className="td-card">
            <h2 className="td-h2">Getting started</h2>
            <div className="td-muted">Ask in chat to add your first task, for example: add "Call the bank" due Friday, high priority.</div>
          </section>
        ) : (
          <section className="td-card">
            <h2 className="td-h2">Tasks</h2>
            <div className="td-seg">
              {[{ value: "active", label: "Active", count: active.length }, { value: "archived", label: "Archived", count: archived.length }].map((o: { value: string; label: string; count: number }) => (
                <button key={o.value} className="td-segbtn" data-on={view === o.value ? "1" : "0"} onClick={() => setView(o.value)}>
                  {o.label}<span className="td-count">{o.count}</span>
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
            <div className="td-filters">
              <SelectBox label="Sort by" options={sortable.map((f: Field) => ({ value: f.key, label: f.label }))} value={sortKey} onChange={(v: string) => setSortKey(v)} />
              <SelectBox label="Order" options={[{ value: "asc", label: "Ascending" }, { value: "desc", label: "Descending" }]} value={dir} onChange={(v: string) => setDir(v)} />
              {enumFilters.map((f: Field) => (
                <SelectBox key={f.key} label={f.label} options={[{ value: ALL, label: "All" }, ...(f.options ?? []).map((o: string) => ({ value: o, label: o }))]} value={filters[f.key] ?? ALL} onChange={(v: string) => setFilters({ ...filters, [f.key]: v })} />
              ))}
              {tagFields.map((f: Field) => {
                const tags = Array.from(new Set(TASKS.flatMap((t: Task) => (Array.isArray(t[f.key]) ? (t[f.key] as string[]) : [])))).sort();
                return <SelectBox key={f.key} label={f.label} options={[{ value: ALL, label: "All" }, ...tags.map((o: string) => ({ value: o, label: o }))]} value={filters[f.key] ?? ALL} onChange={(v: string) => setFilters({ ...filters, [f.key]: v })} />;
              })}
              <label className="td-field">
                Search
                <input className="td-ctl" type="text" value={query} placeholder="Search text" onChange={(e: ChangeEvent<HTMLInputElement>) => setQuery(e.target.value)} />
              </label>
            </div>
            {rows.length === 0 ? (
              <div className="td-muted">No tasks match this view.</div>
            ) : narrow ? (
              <div className="td-cards">
                {rows.map((t: Task) => (
                  <div key={t.id} className="td-tcard">
                    <div className="td-ttl">{show(t.title)}</div>
                    <div className="td-chips">{chipFields.filter((f: Field) => show(t[f.key]) !== "").map((f: Field) => chip(show(t[f.key])))}</div>
                    {metaFields.some((f: Field) => show(t[f.key]) !== "") && (
                      <div className="td-meta">{metaFields.filter((f: Field) => show(t[f.key]) !== "").map((f: Field) => `${f.label}: ${show(t[f.key])}`).join(" · ")}</div>
                    )}
                  </div>
                ))}
              </div>
            ) : (
              <div className="td-tablewrap">
                <table className="td-table">
                  <thead><tr>{FIELDS.map((f: Field) => <th key={f.key}>{f.label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
                  <tbody>
                    {rows.map((t: Task) => (
                      <tr key={t.id}>{FIELDS.map((f: Field) => <td key={f.key}>{cell(f, t)}</td>)}</tr>
                    ))}
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            )}
          </section>
        )}

        <section className="td-card">
          <h2 className="td-h2">Settings</h2>
          <div className="td-props">
            <div className="td-prop"><span className="td-muted">Auto-delete archived</span><span className={SETTINGS.autoDelete ? "td-on" : ""}>{SETTINGS.autoDelete ? `On, after ${SETTINGS.retentionDays} days` : "Off"}</span></div>
            <div className="td-prop"><span className="td-muted">Retention</span><span>{`${SETTINGS.retentionDays} days`}</span></div>
            <div className="td-prop"><span className="td-muted">Daily summary</span><span className={SETTINGS.dailySummary ? "td-on" : ""}>{SETTINGS.dailySummary ? "On" : "Off"}</span></div>
          </div>
        </section>
        {/* Default Granitek footer. Keep it unless the owner asks to change it. */}
        <footer className="td-foot"><a href="https://granitek.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Provided by Granitek Innovations, LLC</a></footer>
      </div>
    </div>
  );
}
```
